# scripts/opcount: `irframe bench update N` calls a body that updates the
# cell in its body, with no exit action, N times (STATIC-EXIT2): the share
# of the exit workload's cost that is the cell's update and the call, not
# the frame. The control locks, adds and unlocks in the body.
unit call
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench update {n}
control benchmarks/frame/testdata/control
